From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:09:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 255/260] [ae-patch] Keep a subagent's settle from overwriting
 a resume, and leave one waiting on a prompt alone

The Disconnected settle now re-checks a per-child generation, the cached status and the blocked-on cache after every await and aborts (clearing its labels) if the child moved. A child blocked on a user prompt is never settled, the startup sweep covers persisted waiting rows, and the stale-after env value must be finite.
